#
# The genmon plugin's configuration. Genmon is the one panel plugin that keeps
# its settings in an rc file rather than in xfconf (learned by watching the
# mock show "(genmon)XXX" while perfectly valid xfconf properties sat unread),
# so this ships to ~/.config/xfce4/panel/genmon-19.rc — the 19 matches the
# plugin id in xfce4-panel.xml.
Command=/usr/local/bin/sentineldesk-status.sh
UseLabel=0
Text=
UpdatePeriod=2000
